{"id":"en-r-5gfir9.de","jokeId":"en-r-5gfir9","locale":"de","adaptation":"reworked","notes":"German has the same 'Hallo Hunger/Müde, ich bin Papa' dad joke; set it up with 'Ich bin müde' first so 'Hallo Schwul' reads as the dad-joke reflex, not a slur.","title":"Hallo, ich bin Papa","location":"gostinaya","cast":["zhena","paren","muzhik"],"roles":{"zhena":"mother","paren":"son","muzhik":"father"},"lines":[{"character":"paren","text":"Ich bin so müde.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Hallo Müde, ich bin Papa.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Hör endlich auf damit.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"paren","text":"Mama, Papa, ich muss euch was sagen. Ich bin schwul.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Wag es ja nicht!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Ich sag doch gar nichts.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Ich sehe genau, wie du schwitzt.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Hallo Schwul, ich bin Papa!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-7rh7qn.en","jokeId":"en-r-7rh7qn","locale":"en","adaptation":"original","notes":"The waiter plays a movie-cop exit; the 'twenty years' line sells the cliche before the boss deflates it.","title":"Badge and Gun","location":"bar","cast":["nachalnik","barmen"],"roles":{"nachalnik":"boss","barmen":"waiter"},"lines":[{"character":"nachalnik","text":"That's it. You're fired.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Fine. You want my badge? Here's my badge.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"And here's my gun.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Twenty years on the job, Chief. And this is how it ends.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"nachalnik","text":"You're a waiter. Where did you even get those?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-7rh7qn.ru","jokeId":"en-r-7rh7qn","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Straight translation; the cop-movie cliche works the same in Russian.","title":"Значок и пистолет","location":"bar","cast":["nachalnik","barmen"],"roles":{"nachalnik":"boss","barmen":"waiter"},"lines":[{"character":"nachalnik","text":"Всё. Ты уволен.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Ладно. Нужен значок? Вот значок.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"И пистолет.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Двадцать лет на этой работе, шеф. И вот как всё кончается.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"nachalnik","text":"Ты официант. Откуда у тебя это всё?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-7rh7qn.de","jokeId":"en-r-7rh7qn","locale":"de","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Straight translation with formal Sie between boss and waiter.","title":"Marke und Waffe","location":"bar","cast":["nachalnik","barmen"],"roles":{"nachalnik":"boss","barmen":"waiter"},"lines":[{"character":"nachalnik","text":"Das war's. Sie sind gefeuert.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Schön. Sie wollen meine Marke? Hier ist meine Marke.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Und meine Waffe.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Zwanzig Jahre in diesem Job, Chef. Und so endet es.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"nachalnik","text":"Sie sind Kellner. Wo haben Sie das Zeug überhaupt her?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-f9f6q6.en","jokeId":"en-r-f9f6q6","locale":"en","adaptation":"original","notes":"Turned the narrated firing into a scene with a widow and the boss, who walks in; narrator avoids saying 'funeral home' so the boss's line is the reveal.","title":"Smoking or Non-Smoking","location":"ulitsa","cast":["zhena","paren","nachalnik"],"roles":{"zhena":"wife","paren":"employee","nachalnik":"boss"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"First day on the new job.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"paren","text":"I'm so sorry for your loss, ma'am.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"paren","text":"So, for your husband. Smoking or non-smoking?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"I beg your pardon?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"nachalnik","text":"That's it. You're fired.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3,"enter":["nachalnik"]},{"character":"paren","text":"Why? I was polite!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"nachalnik","text":"Here we say cremation or burial!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-f9f6q6.ru","jokeId":"en-r-f9f6q6","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"'Место для курящих или некурящих' is the familiar restaurant phrasing; staged as a scene with the boss walking in.","title":"Для курящих","location":"ulitsa","cast":["zhena","paren","nachalnik"],"roles":{"zhena":"wife","paren":"employee","nachalnik":"boss"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Первый день на новой работе.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"paren","text":"Примите мои соболезнования.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"paren","text":"Вашему мужу место для курящих или для некурящих?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Простите, что?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"nachalnik","text":"Всё. Ты уволен.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3,"enter":["nachalnik"]},{"character":"paren","text":"За что? Я же вежливо!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"nachalnik","text":"У нас говорят: кремация или погребение!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-f9f6q6.de","jokeId":"en-r-f9f6q6","locale":"de","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Used the real German terms Feuer- or Erdbestattung, where 'Feuer' echoes the smoking question.","title":"Raucher oder Nichtraucher","location":"ulitsa","cast":["zhena","paren","nachalnik"],"roles":{"zhena":"wife","paren":"employee","nachalnik":"boss"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Erster Tag im neuen Job.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"paren","text":"Mein herzliches Beileid.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"paren","text":"Und für Ihren Mann: Raucher oder Nichtraucher?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Wie bitte?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"nachalnik","text":"Das reicht. Sie sind gefeuert.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3,"enter":["nachalnik"]},{"character":"paren","text":"Wieso? Ich war doch höflich!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"nachalnik","text":"Bei uns heißt das Feuer- oder Erdbestattung!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-83q9rz.en","jokeId":"en-r-83q9rz","locale":"en","adaptation":"original","notes":"Kept the dialogue nearly verbatim; the condition sentence returns as the password.","title":"The Wifi Password","location":"bar","cast":["muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"muzhik":"customer","barmen":"bartender"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik","text":"What's the wifi password?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"You need to buy a drink first.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Okay. I'll have a coke.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Is Pepsi okay?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Sure. How much?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Three dollars.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"There you go. So, what's the wifi password?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"barmen","text":"You need to buy a drink first. No spaces, all lowercase.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-83q9rz.ru","jokeId":"en-r-83q9rz","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"'Сначала закажите напиток' works as both condition and password; 'слитно' replaces 'no spaces'; price in roubles.","title":"Пароль от вайфая","location":"bar","cast":["muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"muzhik":"customer","barmen":"bartender"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik","text":"Какой пароль от вайфая?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Сначала закажите напиток.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Ладно. Колу, пожалуйста.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Пепси подойдёт?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Давайте. Сколько с меня?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Сто пятьдесят рублей.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Держите. Так какой пароль от вайфая?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"barmen","text":"Сначала закажите напиток. Слитно, маленькими буквами.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-83q9rz.de","jokeId":"en-r-83q9rz","locale":"de","adaptation":"direct","notes":"'Erst ein Getränk bestellen' reads as both an instruction and a password; price in euros.","title":"Das WLAN-Passwort","location":"bar","cast":["muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"muzhik":"customer","barmen":"bartender"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik","text":"Wie ist das WLAN-Passwort?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Erst ein Getränk bestellen.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Okay. Eine Cola, bitte.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Ist Pepsi okay?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Klar. Was macht das?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Drei Euro.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Bitte schön. Also, wie ist das WLAN-Passwort?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"barmen","text":"Erst ein Getränk bestellen. Alles klein, ohne Leerzeichen.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-aji6wu.en","jokeId":"en-r-aji6wu","locale":"en","adaptation":"original","notes":"Added a short solemn lead-in so the boast lands as a confession.","title":"War Stories","location":"gostinaya","cast":["muzhik","paren"],"roles":{"muzhik":"father","paren":"son"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik","text":"Son, it's time you knew the truth.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"In Iraq, I killed fifteen people.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"paren","text":"Dad, you were a helicopter mechanic.","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Never said I was a good one.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-aji6wu.ru","jokeId":"en-r-aji6wu","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"'Ты же там вертолёты чинил' sets up 'не говорил, что чинил хорошо' naturally.","title":"Боевые истории","location":"gostinaya","cast":["muzhik","paren"],"roles":{"muzhik":"father","paren":"son"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik","text":"Сынок, пора тебе узнать правду.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"В Ираке я убил пятнадцать человек.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"paren","text":"Пап, ты же там вертолёты чинил.","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"muzhik","text":"А я не говорил, что чинил хорошо.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-aji6wu.de","jokeId":"en-r-aji6wu","locale":"de","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Straight translation.","title":"Kriegsgeschichten","location":"gostinaya","cast":["muzhik","paren"],"roles":{"muzhik":"father","paren":"son"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik","text":"Mein Sohn, es wird Zeit, dass du die Wahrheit erfährst.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Im Irak habe ich fünfzehn Menschen getötet.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"paren","text":"Papa, du warst Hubschraubermechaniker.","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Ich hab nie gesagt, dass ich ein guter war.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-dswgsp.en","jokeId":"en-r-dswgsp","locale":"en","adaptation":"original","notes":"Two friends tell the joke on screen; the friend is the neighbor-family double; the old man exits after his punchline as he gets off the bus.","title":"The Bus Joke","location":"doroga","cast":["muzhik","muzhik-sosed","ded"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","muzhik-sosed":"friend","ded":"old-man"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Hey, listen to this one.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"What do you do if you see an epileptic having a fit in the bath?","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"What?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Throw in your laundry.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"ded","text":"I think that's disgusting.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"ded","text":"My son died in the bath having a fit.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Oh God. We're so sorry, sir.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"We had no idea.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"ded","text":"He choked on a sock.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"exit":["ded"]}]}
{"id":"en-r-dswgsp.ru","jokeId":"en-r-dswgsp","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Same staging; 'носком подавился' keeps the deadpan reveal short.","title":"Анекдот в автобусе","location":"doroga","cast":["muzhik","muzhik-sosed","ded"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","muzhik-sosed":"friend","ded":"old-man"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Слушай анекдот.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Что делать, если эпилептик забился в припадке в ванне?","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Что?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Закинуть туда грязное бельё.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"ded","text":"Как вам не стыдно.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"ded","text":"У меня сын умер в ванне во время припадка.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Господи. Простите нас, пожалуйста.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Мы же не знали.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"ded","text":"Носком подавился.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"exit":["ded"]}]}
{"id":"en-r-dswgsp.de","jokeId":"en-r-dswgsp","locale":"de","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Same staging; old man exits after the punchline.","title":"Der Witz im Bus","location":"doroga","cast":["muzhik","muzhik-sosed","ded"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","muzhik-sosed":"friend","ded":"old-man"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Hör dir den an.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Was macht man, wenn ein Epileptiker in der Badewanne einen Anfall hat?","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Na?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Man wirft die Wäsche rein.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"ded","text":"Das ist widerlich.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"ded","text":"Mein Sohn ist bei einem Anfall in der Badewanne gestorben.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Oh Gott. Das tut uns so leid.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Das wussten wir nicht.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"ded","text":"Er ist an einer Socke erstickt.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"exit":["ded"]}]}
{"id":"en-r-7cvial.en","jokeId":"en-r-7cvial","locale":"en","adaptation":"original","notes":"Dropped the overhearing frame and played the exchange directly; kept the suggested male customer, so 'sir' instead of 'ma'am'.","title":"Bigger Turkeys","location":"magazin","cast":["muzhik","paren"],"roles":{"muzhik":"customer","paren":"employee"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik","text":"Excuse me, young man.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"I need a turkey for Thanksgiving, but these are all too small for my family.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Do these turkeys get any bigger?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"paren","text":"No, sir. They're dead.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-7cvial.ru","jokeId":"en-r-7cvial","locale":"ru","adaptation":"reworked","notes":"'А побольше они не будут?' reads as shop-speak 'do you have bigger ones' and literally 'won't they get bigger'; Thanksgiving swapped for New Year.","title":"Индейка покрупнее","location":"magazin","cast":["muzhik","paren"],"roles":{"muzhik":"customer","paren":"employee"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik","text":"Молодой человек, можно вас?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Мне на Новый год индейка нужна, а тут все мелкие. На всю семью не хватит.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"А побольше они не будут?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"paren","text":"Не будут. Они мёртвые.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-7cvial.de","jokeId":"en-r-7cvial","locale":"de","adaptation":"direct","notes":"'Werden die noch größer?' keeps both readings; Thanksgiving swapped for Christmas.","title":"Größere Puten","location":"magazin","cast":["muzhik","paren"],"roles":{"muzhik":"customer","paren":"employee"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik","text":"Entschuldigung, junger Mann.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Ich brauche eine Pute für Weihnachten, aber die sind alle zu klein für meine Familie.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Werden die noch größer?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"paren","text":"Nein. Die sind tot.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-b03ncg.en","jokeId":"en-r-b03ncg","locale":"en","adaptation":"original","notes":"One narrator line establishes the phone call; the question is split into two short lines.","title":"The Voodoo Doll","location":"ofis","cast":["muzhik","zhena"],"roles":{"muzhik":"husband","zhena":"wife"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"A husband calls his wife at work.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Honey, quick question.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Do you ever get a shooting pain across your body?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Like someone's got a voodoo doll of you and they're stabbing it?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"No. Why? Are you okay?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"muzhik","text":"How about now?","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
